## Lab-Grown Asscher Engagement Ring Prices — Stone + Setting

Lab Asscher diamonds eliminate the Clarity Escalator cost entirely. D-IF at 1.52ct for $2,795. D-FL at 2ct for $5,510.

The Hall of Mirrors effect looks identical to natural — the cut physics are the same, the facet pattern is identical, and step cuts do not hide origin the way brilliant cuts do.

